<title>Q Coffee Shop — Меню</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f7f4ef;--card:#fff;--text:#191714;--muted:#777168;--line:#e7e0d6;--accent:#222;--radius:22px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display","Segoe UI",sans-serif}
